{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ur4jP9gP1Ce5S4QukzcNz7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the JIRA issue that tracks the KIP-1351 proposal about --cancel-all in kafka-reassign-partitions is **KAFKA-20614**.\\\\n\\\\nThis was created by Manan Gupta on 2026-05-26, with the full title: \\\\\\\"KIP-1351: Add --cancel-all to kafka-reassign-partitions\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe issue describes adding an optional `cancel-all` argument to `kafka-reassign-partitions.sh` so operators can stop all ongoing inter-broker partition reassignments using a single parameter via the existing Admin API.\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/05/26/jira-13652366-created-abf0c427.md` - JIRA issue creation event\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/05/26/mail-89bbe11d99bac4f7901570fe-f621db41.md` - Manan Gupta's mailing list discussion post\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/05/26/mail-c0a975ef30702ac2b69cff7a-eb1f77b5.md` - JIRA notification email on the mailing list\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/05/26/jira-13652366-created-abf0c427.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/05/26/mail-89bbe11d99bac4f7901570fe-f621db41.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/05/26/mail-c0a975ef30702ac2b69cff7a-eb1f77b5.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":19.39,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":53569,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":8973,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.029479900000000003,\\\"input_tokens\\\":42,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1227}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9285ba42-8aa2-4690-a64e-d61ad8d2b638","uuid":"eb0bcf97-f05c-4836-bbd3-b3e736d670d1","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:40:20.890Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the JIRA issue that tracks the KIP-1351 proposal about --cancel-all in kafka-reassign-partitions is **KAFKA-20614**.\\\\n\\\\nThis was created by Manan Gupta on 2026-05-26,